{"unit_id":"benzhoupo__dsh-effort-config#card-zh","repo":"benzhoupo/dsh-effort-config","commit":"a8c5d75a7be3d6da58e8ae7a5425e98b6f3ec584","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-effort-config 是 DSH web 客户端的模型思考档位配置插件。它在设置页展示提供商和模型，并将修改保存到 llm-pi-ai 用户设置。用户可为模型声明 off、minimal、low、medium、high、xhigh、max 档位及 provider wire 值，设置路由默认档位，并配置 Anthropic token 预算。界面还支持添加目录提供商及删除其配置，保存后可在原生模型选择器的 Effort 面板调节档位，适合需要管理第三方模型推理行为的 DSH 用户。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:12-16","client.js:16-18","client.js:332-388","client.js:1181-1194"]}
{"unit_id":"benzhoupo__dsh-effort-config#card-en","repo":"benzhoupo/dsh-effort-config","commit":"a8c5d75a7be3d6da58e8ae7a5425e98b6f3ec584","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-effort-config adds a settings page to the DSH web client for third-party model reasoning levels. It saves model wire values, route defaults, and Anthropic token budgets in llm-pi-ai settings. Users can enable catalog providers and adjust declared levels in the native model picker.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:12-16","client.js:16-18","client.js:332-388","client.js:1181-1194"]}
